        "id": 131626,
        "name": "Medic-Tank",
        "username": "Medic-Tank",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/medic-tank/{size}/2107_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-02-17T02:03:13.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Safest way would be bringing DW Fixer along if it really scares you. I just make sure she plays before those who can destroy ongoings and inside the team that's Tempest and AA. You could also add an extra play from AA to play consecrated ground on the available list.</p>",
